keywords:
  - celestial mechanics
  - evection resonance
  - exomoons
  - white dwarfs
  - stellar mass loss
abstract: >-
  An open simulator for the sweeping of the evection resonance through satellite
  systems by stellar mass loss, with an orbit-averaged secular model, direct
  three-body integrations with mass loss, a semi-analytic solar mass-loss history,
  Laplace-Lagrange theory for real satellites and a verification suite.
